# Every text file in this repository is LF, on every checkout (TL-463).
#
# Git for Windows converts to CRLF on checkout by default, and the first
# Windows run of the suite was mostly that: patterns written against `\n`
# reading files that ended their lines in `\r\n`. The repository fixes its
# own encoding rather than leaving it to the cloning machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
